@startuml
title End-to-End Consistency: TripPublished -> NotificationCreated
actor Driver
participant "ShareTrip\nService" as Producer
database "Trip DB" as ProducerDB
participant "Outbox\nRelay" as Relay
queue "Kafka" as Kafka
participant "Notification\nService" as Consumer
database "Notification DB" as ConsumerDB

Driver -> Producer : POST /trips/{id}/publish
Producer -> ProducerDB : tx: Save Trip + Outbox Event
ProducerDB --> Producer : ok
Producer --> Driver : 200 OK

== Outbox Relay ==
Relay -> ProducerDB : Read unsent events
Relay -> Kafka : Publish TripPublished event
Kafka --> Relay : ack
Relay -> ProducerDB : Mark outbox event as sent

== Inbox Consumer ==
Kafka -> Consumer : Deliver event
Consumer -> ConsumerDB : tx: Check processed_events + Create notification
ConsumerDB --> Consumer : ok
Consumer -> Kafka : Commit consumer offset
@enduml
